      "excerpt": "Our Investment Thesis - Wavemaker Ventures Skip to main content Wavemaker Ventures Get in touch About Our Investment Thesis Our Partnership Approach Sustainability Wavemaker Partners Our Portfolio Our Team News and Insights Contact Menu About Our Investment Thesis Our Partnership Approach Sustainability Wavemaker Partners Our Portfolio Our Team News and Insights Contact Get in touch Our Investment Thesis Uncovering unobvious opportunities We exist to back companies that are often overlooked and undervalued, but hold the potential to create lasting value and positive change. Our Investment Thesis Our Investment Thesis Strong conviction on our focus areas We are the leading VC firm investing in early-stage Enterprise, Deep Tech, and Sustainability startups in Southeast Asia. Since 2012, we have made over 200 investments with US$500M AUM across 5 funds—each the largest of its kind at the time. No other firm in the region matches our dedication to these sectors. A sharp eye for unobvious opportunities Our investment philosophy is grounded in uncovering value where others see none. We seek out highly promising yet undervalued companies, driven by the equation: “Opportunity = Value – Perception.” By embracing Peter Thiel’s question, “What important truth do you believe that very few people agree with?”, we partner with founders who possess unique industry or technology insights."
